---
interface Props {
  internalTransfer?: boolean;
  measurementBoundary?: boolean;
}
const { internalTransfer = false, measurementBoundary = false } = Astro.props;
---

<aside class="evidence-note-scope">
  <strong>Evidence note（证据笔记）</strong>
  <span>这篇笔记记录某一次具体实验。截止 H1.41 时能够支持的整体结论，可以在 <a href="/research/seed-openevo/results/">研究结果</a> 中查看。</span>
  {internalTransfer && <span class="scope-warning">该实验中的 fresh task（新任务）属于 OpenEvo internal fresh task-ID-disjoint evaluation（OpenEvo 内部新任务、任务 ID 不重叠评估），任务来自 goal_idx ≥ 500；不是 SEED official held-out evaluation（SEED 官方保留任务评估）。</span>}
  {measurementBoundary && <span class="scope-warning">H1.42 发生在 H1.41 之后，因此它能说明后续 measurement-boundary（测量边界）问题，但不能反过来改变 H1.41 时点已经成立或尚未成立的结论。</span>}
</aside>

<style>
  .evidence-note-scope{width:min(980px,calc(100% - 2rem));margin:1.25rem auto 0;padding:1rem 1.1rem;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;background:var(--surface-muted);color:var(--muted)}
  .evidence-note-scope strong,.evidence-note-scope span{display:block}.evidence-note-scope strong{color:var(--ink);font-size:.78rem}.evidence-note-scope span{margin-top:.35rem;font-size:.76rem;line-height:1.6}.evidence-note-scope a{color:var(--accent-deep);font-weight:750}.evidence-note-scope .scope-warning{padding-top:.55rem;border-top:1px solid var(--line);color:var(--ink)}
</style>
